# Scratch the tools in this directory write.
#
# out/          compiler output: troupec puts a program's .js and, under -v, its
#               stage dumps in an out/ beside the program (key/, viewer/)
# __pycache__/  python bytecode; simulate.py imports btmodel and tmuxdrv
#
# The rest of the scratch lands outside the checkout: each harness works in
# /tmp/battallion-<name>, the simulator in $BT_SCRATCH (default
# /tmp/battallion-sim), and driver.py in the session directory it is given.
out/
__pycache__/
